als](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=clingen-exhibit-booth-materials#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Curation Activity Procedures](/site/assets/files/3395/002-file.svg)Curation Activity Procedures](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=curation-activity-procedures#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Conflict Of Interest (COI)](/site/assets/files/2195/002-file.svg)Conflict Of Interest (COI)](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=conflict-of-interest-coi#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Data Sharing Resources](/site/assets/files/3052/002-file.svg)Data Sharing Resources](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=data-sharing-resources#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Expert Panel Applications](/site/assets/files/2196/002-file.svg)Expert Panel Applications](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=expert-panel-status-steps#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![News](/site/assets/files/2184/002-file.svg)News](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=in-the-news#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![MOC/CME Forms](/site/assets/files/2119/002-file.svg)MOC/CME Forms](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=moc-cme-forms#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Patient Data Sharing](/site/assets/files/2120/002-file.svg)Patient Data Sharing](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=patient-data-sharing#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Policies/Position Statements](/site/assets/files/2115/002-file.svg)Policies/Position Statements](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=policies-position-statements#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Presentations](/site/assets/files/2176/002-file.svg)Presentations](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=presentations#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Publications](/site/assets/files/3394/002-file.svg)Publications](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=publications#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Supporting Documents](/site/assets/files/2122/002-file.svg)Supporting Documents](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=supporting-documents#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Training Materials](/site/assets/files/2116/002-file.svg)Training Materials](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=training-materials#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Website Updates](/site/assets/files/6235/002-file.svg)Website Updates](https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=website-updates#list_documentation_table)\n-   [Tools](https://clinicalgenome.org/tools/)\n\nGene\n\n-   Gene Symbol\n-   Gene Name\n-   Disease Name\n-   Drug Name\n-   Region (GRCh37)\n-   Region (GRCh38)\n\n-   [Variant](http://reg.clinicalgenome.org)\n-   [Website Content](https://clinicalgenome.org/search/)\n\n     Search\n\n-   [Curated Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/curations)\n    -   [All Curated Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/curations)\n    -   [ACMG SF v3.3 Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/acmgsf)\n-   [Gene-Disease Validity](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-validity)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-validity)\n    -   [Curations by Expert Panel](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/affiliate)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_gene-disease-validity')\n-   [Dosage Sensitivity](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage)\n    -   [Recurrent CNV](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage/cnv)\n    \n    -   [FTP File Downloads (CSV, BED, TSV)](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_dosage')\n-   [Clinical Actionability](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/actionability)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/actionability)\n    -   [Curations in Adult Context](https://actionability.clinicalgenome.org/ac/Adult/ui/summ)\n    -   [Curations in Pediatric Context](https://actionability.clinicalgenome.org/ac/Pediatric/ui/summ)\n    -   [Scoring Metric](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/semi-quantitative-scoring-metric/)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_actionability)\n-   [Curated Variants](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads#section_variant)\n-   [Statistics](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/reports/stats)\n-   [More](#)\n    -   [All Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes)\n    -   [All Disease](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/conditions)\n    -   [All Drugs & Medications](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/drugs)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads)\n-   [](#)\n    -   [About ClinGen's Website](/tools/clingen-website-faq/)\n    -   [Learn About New Features](/docs/?doc-type=website-updates)\n    -   [How To Cite ClinGen](/tools/clingen-website-faq/how-to-cite/)\n    -   [External Data Attribution](/tools/clingen-website-faq/attribution/)\n    -   [Contact Us](/about/contact-clingen/)\n\n# About ClinGen Expert Panels\n\nClinGen's Expert Panels are implementing the standards developed by our [curation activities](http://clingen2019marketingsite.test/curation-activities/) to improve genomics knowledge.\n\n-   [\n    \n    Clinical Domain Working Groups\n    \n    Gene Curation Expert Panels\n    \n    Variant Curation Expert Panels\n    \n    \n    \n    ](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/)\n-   [\n    \n    Gene Curation Working Group\n    \n    \n    \n    ](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/gene-curation/)\n-   [\n    \n    Dosage Sensitivity Working Group\n    \n    \n    \n    ](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/dosage-sensitivity-curation/)\n-   [\n    \n    Clinical Actionability Working Group\n    \n    \n    \n    ](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/actionability/)\n\nOne specific goal of ClinGen is to develop teams of experts in different clinical domains to evaluate the clinical validity of gene-disease relationships and pathogenicity of individual genetic variants.\n\n**About Gene Curation Expert Panels**  \nGene Curation Expert Panels implement an approved process of evaluating the strength of evidence supporting or refuting a claim that variation in a particular gene causes a particular disease.\n\n**Interested in volunteering to curate for ClinGen?** Please take this brief **[survey](/tools/clingen-volunteer-survey/)** to tell us more about your interests, expertise, and desired level of involvement so we can pair you with an appropriate curation activity and/or Expert Panel. \n\n**Interested in contributing your expert knowledge and/or data to a ClinGen GCEP?** Please take this brief **[survey](/tools/expert-volunteer-survey/)** to tell us more about your interests and expertise so we can pair you with the approproate GCEP, if available. \n\n**Interested in starting an Expert Panel?** See our [guidelines for applying for Gene Curation Expert Panel Status](/docs/guidelines-for-applying-for-variant-or-gene-curation-expert-panel-status/).\n\n**About Variant Curation Expert Panels**  \nVariant Curation Expert Panels evaluate evidence to classify a genomic variant on a spectrum from pathogenic to benign with respect to a particular disease and inheritance pattern.\n\n**Interested in volunteering to curate for ClinGen?** Please take this brief **[survey](/tools/clingen-volunteer-survey/)** to tell us more about your interests, expertise, and desired level of involvement so we can pair you with an appropriate curation activity and/or Expert Panel. \n\n**Interested in contributing your expert knowledge and/or data to a ClinGen VCEP?** Please take this brief **[survey](/tools/expert-volunteer-survey/)** to tell us more about your interests and expertise so we can pair you with the approproate VCEP, if available. \n\n**Interested in starting an Expert Panel?** See our [guidelines for applying for Variant Curation Expert Panel Status](/docs/guidelines-for-applying-for-variant-or-gene-curation-expert-panel-status/).\n\n---\n\n-   Organize Expert Panels:\n-   [By CDWG](/affiliation/#ep_table_heading)\n-   [By GCEP](/affiliation/gcep/#ep_table_heading)\n-   [By VCEP](/affiliation/vcep/#ep_table_heading)\n-   [By Inactive](/affiliation/inactive/#ep_table_heading)\n-   [Show All](/affiliation/all/#ep_table_heading)\n\nExpert Panel Name\n\nType\n\nCDWG\n\nStatus\n\n[\n\nSend Feedback\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/contact/share-feedback/?title=Expert%20Panels&page=https%3A%2F%2Fclinicalgenome.org%2Faffiliation%2F&ref=edwg)\n\n---\n\nThe information on this website is not intended for direct diagnostic use or medical decision-making without review by a genetics professional. Individuals should not change their health behavior solely on the basis of information contained on this website. If you have questions about the information contained on this website, please see a health care professional.\n\n---\n\n[@ClinGenResource](https://twitter.com/ClinGenResource)\n\n[youtube.com](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsn4nEVUTpVQz70rClgMMsQ)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Get Started\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/start/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Curation Activities\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/)\n\n-   [About ClinGen's Curation Activities](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/about-curation-activities/)\n-   [Gene-Disease Validity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/gene-disease-validity/)\n-   [Variant Pathogenicity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/variant-pathogenicity/)\n-   [Clinical Actionability](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/clinical-actionability/)\n-   [Dosage Sensitivity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/dosage-sensitivity/)\n-